{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model using scgpt RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder with concatenation fusion in a multiprofile setup. Validation accuracy of 0.5176 and F1 of 0.4837 are lower than the prior scvi_n200 + ViT setup (0.7062), suggesting the RNA encoder choice may influence performance. Uncertainty remains about whether the observed difference stems from the RNA encoder itself or interactions with the fusion method, as the prior comparison used weighted fusion instead of concatenation."
}

